title: Agent sessions beside the editor
session_cwd: ~/tour
flow: Agent sessions live in panes next to your code: the SESSIONS rail lists them, a new one opens in a split, and the sessions table shows every session with its state (the session is a recording stand-in; no model runs).
open src/main.zig
until "fn main"
record
wait 900
run view.activity_sessions
wait 1600
run ai.claude_code_new_right
until "agent session" 4000
wait 5200
run sessions.table
wait 2400
poster
keys @450 down down down
wait 1600
key esc
wait 400
run view.focus_left
wait 1500
